2.  Awesome Agents. (2026). *RAG Benchmarks Leaderboard: Retrieval Rankings 2026*. Retrieved from [https://awesomeagents.ai/leaderboards/rag-benchmarks-leaderboard/](https://awesomeagents.ai/leaderboards/rag-benchmarks-leaderboard/)
3.  Agentic AI Knowledge Base. (n.d.). *RAG Evaluation Benchmarks*. Retrieved from [https://agentic-ai.readthedocs.io/en/latest/Benchmarks/rag-benchmarks/](https://agentic-ai.readthedocs.io/en/latest/Benchmarks/rag-benchmarks/)
4.  Sun, Y., Rahmfeld, J., Weaver, C., Desai, R., Huang, W., & Butler, M. H. (2026). *EnterpriseRAG-Bench: A RAG Benchmark for Company Internal Knowledge*. arXiv. Retrieved from [https://arxiv.org/html/2605.05253v1](https://arxiv.org/html/2605.05253v1)[0m
